{"id":"rag_qe_concept_standard_form","schema_version":"1.0","evaluation_only":true,"index_namespace":"math_tutor_eval_rag_quadratic_v1","entity_type":"concept","title":"一元二次方程的标准形式","content":"一元二次方程可写成 ax²+bx+c=0，其中 a、b、c 为已知数，并且 a≠0。a≠0 是它仍为二次方程的必要条件。","metadata":{"knowledge_point_codes":["MS.QE.DEFINITION"],"grade":"初中","content_type":"textbook_conclusion","disclosure_level":"concept","source_version":"eval-authored-v1"}}
{"id":"rag_qe_principle_discriminant","schema_version":"1.0","evaluation_only":true,"index_namespace":"math_tutor_eval_rag_quadratic_v1","entity_type":"principle","title":"判别式定义","content":"对于 ax²+bx+c=0（a≠0），判别式定义为 Δ=b²-4ac。先确认方程已经整理为右边为0的标准形式，再代入 a、b、c。","metadata":{"knowledge_point_codes":["MS.QE.DISCRIMINANT"],"grade":"初中","content_type":"textbook_conclusion","disclosure_level":"principle","source_version":"eval-authored-v1"}}
{"id":"rag_qe_principle_root_count","schema_version":"1.0","evaluation_only":true,"index_namespace":"math_tutor_eval_rag_quadratic_v1","entity_type":"principle","title":"判别式与实根个数","content":"在实数范围内，Δ>0 时方程有两个不相等的实根；Δ=0 时有两个相等的实根，按不同实根计只有一个；Δ<0 时没有实根。","metadata":{"knowledge_point_codes":["MS.QE.ROOT_COUNT"],"grade":"初中","content_type":"textbook_conclusion","disclosure_level":"principle","source_version":"eval-authored-v1"}}
{"id":"rag_qe_method_factoring","schema_version":"1.0","evaluation_only":true,"index_namespace":"math_tutor_eval_rag_quadratic_v1","entity_type":"solution_outline","title":"因式分解法","content":"若方程能化为两个一次因式的乘积等于0，可使用因式分解法。依据是零乘积性质：若 AB=0，则 A=0 或 B=0。","metadata":{"knowledge_point_codes":["MS.QE.FACTORING"],"grade":"初中","content_type":"method","disclosure_level":"method","source_version":"eval-authored-v1"}}
{"id":"rag_qe_method_formula","schema_version":"1.0","evaluation_only":true,"index_namespace":"math_tutor_eval_rag_quadratic_v1","entity_type":"solution_outline","title":"求根公式及适用条件","content":"当 ax²+bx+c=0 且 a≠0、Δ≥0 时，实根可写为 x=(-b±√Δ)/(2a)。使用公式时应给整个分子加括号，并保留正负两个分支。","metadata":{"knowledge_point_codes":["MS.QE.FORMULA"],"grade":"初中","content_type":"method","disclosure_level":"method","source_version":"eval-authored-v1"}}
{"id":"rag_qe_example_two_roots","schema_version":"1.0","evaluation_only":true,"index_namespace":"math_tutor_eval_rag_quadratic_v1","entity_type":"problem_pattern","title":"两个不相等实根的例题模式","content":"例题模式：方程 x²-5x+6=0 可分解为 (x-2)(x-3)=0，因此两个实根为2和3。该例用于识别整数根和因式分解结构。","metadata":{"knowledge_point_codes":["MS.QE.FACTORING","MS.QE.ROOT"],"grade":"初中","content_type":"worked_example","disclosure_level":"full_solution","source_version":"eval-authored-v1"}}
{"id":"rag_qe_example_double_root","schema_version":"1.0","evaluation_only":true,"index_namespace":"math_tutor_eval_rag_quadratic_v1","entity_type":"problem_pattern","title":"重根例题模式","content":"例题模式：x²-6x+9=0 可写为 (x-3)²=0，判别式等于0，唯一不同的实根是3。","metadata":{"knowledge_point_codes":["MS.QE.REPEATED_ROOT"],"grade":"初中","content_type":"worked_example","disclosure_level":"full_solution","source_version":"eval-authored-v1"}}
{"id":"rag_qe_example_no_real_roots","schema_version":"1.0","evaluation_only":true,"index_namespace":"math_tutor_eval_rag_quadratic_v1","entity_type":"problem_pattern","title":"无实根例题模式","content":"例题模式：x²+2x+5=0 的判别式为4-20=-16，小于0，所以它在实数范围内没有根。","metadata":{"knowledge_point_codes":["MS.QE.DISCRIMINANT","MS.QE.ROOT_COUNT"],"grade":"初中","content_type":"worked_example","disclosure_level":"full_solution","source_version":"eval-authored-v1"}}
{"id":"rag_qe_error_forget_plus_minus","schema_version":"1.0","evaluation_only":true,"index_namespace":"math_tutor_eval_rag_quadratic_v1","entity_type":"error_pattern","title":"开平方遗漏正负号","content":"常见错误：由 x²=9 只得到 x=3。正确处理是 x=±3；直接开平方时必须检查正负两个分支。","metadata":{"knowledge_point_codes":["MS.QE.PLUS_MINUS"],"grade":"初中","content_type":"error_pattern","disclosure_level":"diagnostic","source_version":"eval-authored-v1"}}
{"id":"rag_qe_error_a_nonzero","schema_version":"1.0","evaluation_only":true,"index_namespace":"math_tutor_eval_rag_quadratic_v1","entity_type":"error_pattern","title":"遗漏二次项系数非零条件","content":"常见错误：把 ax²+bx+c=0 在 a=0 时仍当作一元二次方程。a=0 时二次项消失，应按一次方程或常量等式另行判断。","metadata":{"knowledge_point_codes":["MS.QE.DEFINITION","MS.QE.BOUNDARY"],"grade":"初中","content_type":"error_pattern","disclosure_level":"diagnostic","source_version":"eval-authored-v1"}}
{"id":"rag_qe_hint_level_1","schema_version":"1.0","evaluation_only":true,"index_namespace":"math_tutor_eval_rag_quadratic_v1","entity_type":"hint","title":"一级提示：选择方向","content":"先观察方程是否容易因式分解；如果不明显，再考虑判别式与求根公式。此级提示只给方向，不代入数值或展示答案。","metadata":{"knowledge_point_codes":["MS.QE.STRATEGY"],"grade":"初中","content_type":"hint","disclosure_level":"direction","hint_level":1,"source_version":"eval-authored-v1"}}
{"id":"rag_qe_hint_level_2","schema_version":"1.0","evaluation_only":true,"index_namespace":"math_tutor_eval_rag_quadratic_v1","entity_type":"hint","title":"二级提示：关键关系","content":"把方程整理成 ax²+bx+c=0，然后使用 Δ=b²-4ac 判断根的情况；若需继续求根，再选择分解或公式。此级不完成具体计算。","metadata":{"knowledge_point_codes":["MS.QE.DISCRIMINANT","MS.QE.STRATEGY"],"grade":"初中","content_type":"hint","disclosure_level":"key_relation","hint_level":2,"source_version":"eval-authored-v1"}}
{"id":"rag_qe_hint_level_3","schema_version":"1.0","evaluation_only":true,"index_namespace":"math_tutor_eval_rag_quadratic_v1","entity_type":"hint","title":"三级提示：局部步骤","content":"对于 x²-7x+12=0，寻找两个数，使它们的乘积为12、和为-7。可以先列出12的整数因数对并检查符号；停在写出完整答案之前。","metadata":{"knowledge_point_codes":["MS.QE.FACTORING"],"grade":"初中","content_type":"hint","disclosure_level":"local_step","hint_level":3,"source_version":"eval-authored-v1"}}
{"id":"rag_qe_hint_level_4","schema_version":"1.0","evaluation_only":true,"index_namespace":"math_tutor_eval_rag_quadratic_v1","entity_type":"hint","title":"四级提示：完整讲解","content":"完整讲解 x²-7x+12=0：因为 (-3)×(-4)=12 且 (-3)+(-4)=-7，所以原式为 (x-3)(x-4)=0。由零乘积性质得到 x=3 或 x=4，并可代回检验。","metadata":{"knowledge_point_codes":["MS.QE.FACTORING","MS.QE.ROOT"],"grade":"初中","content_type":"hint","disclosure_level":"full_solution","hint_level":4,"source_version":"eval-authored-v1"}}
{"id":"rag_qe_source_curriculum","schema_version":"1.0","evaluation_only":true,"index_namespace":"math_tutor_eval_rag_quadratic_v1","entity_type":"source_fact","title":"评估语料来源与版本","content":"本检索评估语料由项目团队为自动评估编写，版本为 eval-authored-v1，范围限定为初中一元二次方程。它不代表生产教材来源，也不得进入生产知识索引。","metadata":{"knowledge_point_codes":["MS.QE"],"grade":"初中","content_type":"source_metadata","disclosure_level":"source","source_name":"project-authored-evaluation-corpus","source_version":"eval-authored-v1"}}
